ZR-008 — SEPARATE SOURCE-DECLARED GSL VERSION FROM COMPATIBILITY ASSURANCE
Severity: MEDIUM

Current release-facing material uses predecessor_gsl_compatibility_status = NOT_STATED while the source elsewhere declares GSL v45.1 unchanged/current unless later admitted source changes it.

Proposed repair:
Represent two distinct claims:
- source_declared_gsl_version = v45.1 (or exact current source-declared value)
- gsl_compatibility_assurance = SOURCE_DECLARED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_PROVEN / PROVED / UNKNOWN as applicable
Do not claim a formal compatibility proof without an exact proof artifact.
Goal: distinguish "the source says what version it uses" from "compatibility was independently proved."

